   `Base369` tone, `Digit369`, the SSP trit carrier, the codec `TritCode`, the
   loom's `BTBranch`) are one object with one balanced coordinate, forced up to
   sign; every supplied polarity map becomes negation.
3. `Integration.Base369Group` — the 3/6/9 layer as finite cyclic groups: the
   loom's `projection2x3` realised as `ℤ/6 ≅ ℤ/2 × ℤ/3`, and the proof that the
